        "text": "First, I need to find the midpoint of AE. The midpoint M can be calculated by averaging the coordinates:\n\nM_x = (0 + 15)/2 = 7.5\nM_y = (0 + 20)/2 = 10\n\nSo, midpoint M is at (7.5,10)."
