        "text": "Alright, so I have this logic problem with five premises and I need to figure out three things about Emma: whether she must excel in math, computer science, or both, and whether she could excel in both. Let me try to break this down step by step."
      },
      {
        "label": "initializing",
        "text": "First, let me list out the premises again to make sure I have them all:\n\n1. Every student who excels in mathematics also excels in at least one of physics or computer science.\n2. No student who excels in computer science fails to excel in logical reasoning.\n3. Some students who excel in physics do not excel in logical reasoning.\n4. All students who excel in both physics and computer science also excel in mathematics.\n5. Emma excels in physics but does not excel in logical reasoning."
      },
