        "label": "initializing",
        "text": "Let me define some predicates:\n\n- Let M(x) mean \"x excels in mathematics.\"\n- Let P(x) mean \"x excels in physics.\"\n- Let CS(x) mean \"x excels in computer science.\"\n- Let LR(x) mean \"x fails to excel in logical reasoning,\" so ¬LR(x) means \"x excels in logical reasoning.\""
